{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Learn More About \u201cDesserted\u201d</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDesserted\u201d is a cooperative adventure and horror game supporting up to 4 players. Set in a forsaken universe abandoned by the God of Calix, you must work together to survive on different planets. Scavenge diverse food sources, explore intricate mechanisms, and face off against monsters that grow stronger with each passing cycle. When danger strikes, use your wits to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Calix, a mysterious life-sustaining energy, to earn rewards that enhance both yourself and your team, preparing you to tackle increasingly deadly survival cycles. Cooperation is key to conquering the challenges that await in this unforgiving cosmos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>What's in our demo\uff1f</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>solo mode</strong> or <strong>co-op with up to 4 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to <strong>1 map only: Neon-City Hotel</strong> (featuring a garden, casino, firing range, bar, and more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized monster roster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoard Calix and push through each objective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited weapons</strong> can be found or purchased for temporary counterattacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No limit to survival cycles, but death means starting over</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>How to play\uff1f</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/173512a442f24af429435b41d503bf5a.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/7b53e85691b12f4cb2642b64c63481eb.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/7b53e85691b12f4cb2642b64c63481eb.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/7b53e85691b12f4cb2642b64c63481eb.mp4?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every journey is brand-new and never repeats. When the time runs out, the loop ends by force.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/ac01071d5a5122b22f4903ce2725c0d7.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/724ea6477d4f336cb53db107cc10c5a7.mp4?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scour the garden, casino, firing range, and bar for anything remotely edible. Every bite keeps your Calix count rising\u2014and your life meter from hitting zero.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/bb9143d0008aaf9b884b35f69c5fab2e.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/67b5c68e816747d682147e6819e5db23.mp4?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your hard-earned Calix with teammates who are running low. Stage daring rescues to keep the whole crew alive and exploring.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/919713053bbb2da2ef3ef861eb5e7110.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/2140885a111441b9743e22ef58a1916a.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/2140885a111441b9743e22ef58a1916a.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Not every tactic works; sometimes your weapons or strategies fail, and only teamwork keeps you alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/071949892c24ba7f227cde376794359a.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/8961023de048beb2a297d8916669ab9b.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/8961023de048beb2a297d8916669ab9b.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn scavenged items into makeshift weapons to outsmart creatures. Teamwork and quick thinking are key.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/3a546f86d361c6e292cc4483eedb4f9d.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.webm?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/2d233eb122b8ce1e394bf8a992082512.mp4?t=1759376391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sacrify your own Calix at special terminals to earn coins, then spend them on upgrades. Push deeper into the unknown environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ADD TO WISHLIST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo offers a focused slice of the full game\u2014one map, a rotating roster of monsters, and limited upgrades\u2014so you can taste the tension before launch: more maps, richer environments, and deeper adventures in the full release of Desserted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the night, hit your Calix quota, and get a preview of the dangerous delights waiting in the complete Desserted experience.</strong> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038970?t=1759376391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038970?t=1759376391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/0c377e607d5ef21874852f569982f102eb9631bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759376391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/0c377e607d5ef21874852f569982f102eb9631bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759376391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Learn More About \u201cDesserted\u201d</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cDesserted\u201d is a cooperative adventure and horror game supporting up to 4 players. Set in a forsaken universe abandoned by the God of Calix, you must work together to survive on different planets. Scavenge diverse food sources, explore intricate mechanisms, and face off against monsters that grow stronger with each passing cycle. When danger strikes, use your wits to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain Calix, a mysterious life-sustaining energy, to earn rewards that enhance both yourself and your team, preparing you to tackle increasingly deadly survival cycles. Cooperation is key to conquering the challenges that await in this unforgiving cosmos.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>What's in our demo\uff1f</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in <strong>solo mode</strong> or <strong>co-op with up to 4 players</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to <strong>1 map only: Neon-City Hotel</strong> (featuring a garden, casino, firing range, bar, and more)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized monster roster</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoard Calix and push through each objective</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited weapons</strong> can be found or purchased for temporary counterattacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No limit to survival cycles, but death means starting over</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>How to play\uff1f</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/173512a442f24af429435b41d503bf5a.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=174 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038970/extras/7b53e85691b12f4cb2642b64c63481eb.poster.avif?t=1759376391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=